13:T496,Join us for an evening of laughter, socializing, and potential connections at our unique comedy matchmaking event, Match Me Please! Whether you`re looking for love or just want to have a great time, our host will charm the crowd with hilarious crowd play and interactive games designed to bring out the best in everyone. Event Highlights: Comedy & Crowd Play: Our talented host will entertain and engage the audience with witty observations and playful interactions. Matchmaking Fun: Singles will have the chance to meet potential matches in a relaxed and humorous atmosphere. Socializing Opportunities: Enjoy dedicated socializing time between sets to mingle and get to know others. Dress to Impress: Come dressed to impress, as our event creates the perfect backdrop for making a memorable first impression. Laughs & Connections: Laugh along with the crowd and see if you can find that special someone who shares your sense of humor. Whether you`re hoping to find love or just want to enjoy a fun time, Match Me Please! promises to be an evening full of laughter, camaraderie, and maybe even a spark of romance. Get ready to mingle, laugh, and potentially meet your match!7:["$","$L12",null,{"initialActivity":{"id":"91","title":"Match Me Please!","image":"https://assets-in.bmscdn.com/nmcms/events/banner/desktop/media-desktop-match-me-please-0-2024-7-2-t-14-18-20.jpg","tags":["Event"],"priceRange":"₹199.00","location":"Bangalore","lastUpdated":"3/26/2026","categoryIds":["3","5","6"],"categoryNames":[],"description":"$13","date":"Sat, 28 Mar, 2026","time":"10:30 pm","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12.9341,77.6303","contactInfo":"","url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com/events/match-me-please/ET00403378"}}]
